<title>UK: EMI 9-mth pretax pre-exceps down 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>EMI 9-mth pretax pre-exceps down 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		40.4		   vs 42.5</p>
<p> Op profit pre-exceps   305.9		  vs 331.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    293.3		  vs 312.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,564.7		vs 2,689.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit figure is before exceptional items. EPS figure is fully diluted and adjusted.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
